    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d69">

                <pb facs="0189" n="73" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg73"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 493.11/471.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Chinese Legation to the Department of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <p rendition="#center">
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">memorandum</hi>.</p>
                <p>In reply to a telegram from the Legation asking what disposition is to be made of
                    the balance of deposits refundable to China upon the remitted portion of the
                    indemnity, the Foreign Office cabled instruction to the Legation to receive such
                    balance in the same manner as it did last August.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Chinese Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian" when="1914-01-20"><hi
                                rendition="#italic">January 20, 1914</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
